      85.82,
      177.98,
      508.85,
      206.78
    ],
    "text": "WEATHER FORECAST FOR SEA AREAS AROUND THE ISLAND DURING NEXT 24 HOURS",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      186.29,
      211.82,
      408.5,
      224.3
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 05.30 a.m. on 19 November 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0,
      12.479999542236328
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.16,
      242.57,
      533.18,
      288.17
    ],
    "text": "The Severe Cyclonic storm \u201cAkvan\u201d over South and adjoining West-central Bay of Bengal, lay centered, near Latitude 13.9\u00b0N and Longitude 85.3\u00b0E (approximately 740 km northeast to Trincomalee) at around 11.30 p.m. on 18th November 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.16,
      307.01,
      533.28,
      335.93
    ],
    "text": "It is likely to move north-northwestward, and cross North Andhra Pradesh coast, India around 11.30 am of 20th November.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.16,
      350.81,
      533.31,
      396.43
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded by 10N-20N and 80E-95E, until further notice. Further, Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move to safe areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.16,
      411.31,
      532.78,
      437.95
    ],
    "text": "The naval and fishing communities, are requested to be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the Department of Meteorology in this regard.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.16,
      438.7,
      151.53,
      457.03
    ],
    "text": "Condition of Rain:",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      59.16,
      470.23,
      383.42,
      482.23
    ],
    "text": "Mainly fair weather will prevail in the sea areas around the island.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
